      "content": "okay i get it. but if i just dont do a super high dose, like if i just take like 400mg? that's way lower than what i was thinking. is there any way i can tell if my magnesium is actually high enough? like would i feel it working or would i know if i took too much? i just really want to fix these cramps so i can sleep.",
